# Hikvision Recovery - Configuration

## Device Configuration
host: "192.168.1.100"          # Device IP or hostname
username: "admin"               # Username (usually admin)
password: "***"                 # Password (keep secure!)
port: 80                        # HTTP port (default 80)
use_https: false                # Use HTTPS (requires valid SSL cert)
verify_ssl: false               # Verify SSL certificates

## Connection Settings
timeout: 30                     # Request timeout in seconds
max_retries: 3                  # Max retry attempts for failed requests
backoff_factor: 0.5            # Exponential backoff factor
digest_auth: true              # Use Digest authentication (recommended)

## Advanced
user_agent: "HikvisionRecovery/0.1.0"